# Cursor Rules — support.belowthefold.gr

- Always use Next.js App Router and React Server Components
- Use Supabase SSR helpers (@supabase/ssr) for all auth — never the browser client in server components
- Keep all RLS policies and migrations in /supabase/migrations
- Use shadcn/ui components, never raw HTML for UI elements
- All forms use server actions, not client-side fetch
